(1494, 1, 'Big Size Chain #16', 'big-size-chain-16', 'BSC-0016', 595, 862, 46, 'Classic royal Big Size Chain handcrafted with traditional Indian jewelry artistry. Perfectly suited for festive and daily wear.', 'Classic royal Big Size Chain handcrafted with traditional Indian jewelry artistry. Perfectly suited for festive and daily wear. Backed by Rayka Imitation Jewellery quality assurance. Hypoallergenic brass core with anti-tarnish micro gold layer.', '{\"Category\":\"Big Size Chain\",\"Type\":\"big-size-chain\",\"Material\":\"Pure Brass Core\",\"Plating\":\"1 Gram Micro Gold Plating\",\"Finish\":\"High Polish Mirror Finish\",\"Occasion\":\"Festive, Wedding, Daily Wear\",\"Country\":\"India\",\"Views\":\"2 Angles Included\"}', 'Follow these simple care rules to keep your gold plated chain shiny for longer. This guide is useful for all gold plated jewellery (chains, bracelets, rings, pendants, etc.). Plating life depends mainly on water, sweat, chemicals, and storage.\n\nBest Rule: Wear last • Remove first\nAvoid: Water • Sweat • Perfume\nStorage: Separate pouch / box\n\nCare Tips (English):\n• Keep away from water: remove before bath, swimming, rain, or washing face/hands.\n• Avoid chemicals: perfume, deodorant, sanitizer, hairspray, and cleaning liquids can dull the shine.\n• Remove before workout: sweat reduces plating life faster.\n• Wear last, remove first: wear after perfume/makeup dries; remove before sleeping.\n• Wipe after use: gently clean with a soft, dry cloth every time.\n• Store separately: keep in a pouch/box to avoid scratches, rubbing, and tangling.\n• No harsh cleaning: don\'t use toothpaste, brushes, or strong cleaners.\n• If it gets wet: dry immediately with a soft cloth and store only when fully dry.\n• Avoid heat: keep away from long sunlight exposure and high heat areas.\n• Quick tip: If you wear your chain daily, rotate with another chain to reduce plating wear.\n\nदेखभाल के टिप्स (Hindi):\n• पानी से दूर रखें: नहाने, स्विमिंग, बारिश या फेस/ह