(1836, 8, 'Royal 1 Gram Micro Gold Pendant #008', 'royal-1-gram-gold-pendant-008', 'PND-0008', 337, 539, 30, 'Exquisite 1 gram micro gold pendant with fine filigree and anti-tarnish gloss coating.', 'Graceful everyday and spiritual gold pendant with detailed artisanal engraving. Features 24K micro gold plating over durable brass core.', '{\"Base Metal\":\"Premium Brass Core\",\"Plating\":\"24K Micro Gold Plating (1 Gram)\",\"Coating\":\"Anti-Tarnish Protective Shield\",\"Finish\":\"High Gloss Mirror Polish\",\"Hypoallergenic\":\"100% Lead & Nickel Safe\",\"Occasion\":\"Daily Wear & Royal Celebrations\"}', 'Follow these simple care rules to keep your gold plated chain shiny for longer. This guide is useful for all gold plated jewellery (chains, bracelets, rings, pendants, etc.). Plating life depends mainly on water, sweat, chemicals, and storage.\n\nBest Rule: Wear last • Remove first\nAvoid: Water • Sweat • Perfume\nStorage: Separate pouch / box\n\nCare Tips (English):\n• Keep away from water: remove before bath, swimming, rain, or washing face/hands.\n• Avoid chemicals: perfume, deodorant, sanitizer, hairspray, and cleaning liquids can dull the shine.\n• Remove before workout: sweat reduces plating life faster.\n• Wear last, remove first: wear after perfume/makeup dries; remove before sleeping.\n• Wipe after use: gently clean with a soft, dry cloth every time.\n• Store separately: keep in a pouch/box to avoid scratches, rubbing, and tangling.\n• No harsh cleaning: don\'t use toothpaste, brushes, or strong cleaners.\n• If it gets wet: dry immediately with a soft cloth and store only when fully dry.\n• Avoid heat: keep away from long sunlight exposure and high heat areas.\n• Quick tip: If you wear your chain daily, rotate with another chain to reduce plating wear.\n\nदेखभाल के टिप्स (Hindi):\n• पानी से दूर रखें: नहाने, स्विमिंग, बारिश या फेस/हैंड वॉश के समय उतार दें।\n• केमिकल्स से बचाएं: परफ्यूम, डियो, सैनिटाइज़र, हेयर स्प्रे और क्लीनिंग लिक्विड से चमक कम हो सकती है